<title>USA: U.S. Boxed Beef cut-out at 1500 CST - USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. Boxed Beef cut-out at 1500 CST - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Boxed beef higher on light demand and offerings. Select and Choice rib, chuck and round cuts generally firm, while loin cuts higher. Beef trimmings generally steady on light demand and offerings. - USDA</p>
<p>------</p>
<p>------</p>
<p>214 Fab Lds  CH 1-3	CH 1-3	SE 1-3	SE 1-3</p>
<p>  7 50s Lds  550/700     700/850     550/700     700/850</p>
<p>11 Grd Lds ---------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Values =     107.25	107.18	103.83	103.46</p>
<p>Changes	   1.17	  1.22	  1.09	  1.27</p>
<p>Rib	  156.68	156.21	146.91	147.77</p>
<p>Chuck	 77.99	 76.76	 80.49	 76.97</p>
<p>Round	 99.72	 99.72	 99.19	 99.19</p>
